# LF in the repository, always.
#
# This source is VENDORED into homelab-ansible's uctronics_display role, which
# enforces `* text=auto eol=lf` repo-wide. Without this file a Windows checkout
# here is CRLF, and a straight copy imports CRLF into a repo that forbids it --
# turning a five-file change into a seven-file diff where two are pure
# line-ending churn. Caught by hand on the 2026-09-02 re-vendor; this makes it
# not depend on catching it.
#
# It also matters on its own account: these files are compiled on a Pi and the
# addon's shell scripts run in Alpine, where a CR at end of line is part of the
# argument.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
